    /* Eighty-nine rows in a 1000-unit-wide drawing: on a phone the aspect
       ratio squeezes each bar under two device pixels and the chart stops
       being a chart. Below 560px it scrolls sideways instead, and the
       script keeps the needle centred in the frame as the year moves. The
       floor is 560 rather than 640 so the frame at an ordinary laptop
       width clears it outright — 640 left a seven-pixel overflow and a
       real scrollbar under a chart that fitted perfectly well. */
    overflow-x: auto;
